{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00181",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.62,
      "end_seconds": 6.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Good afternoon, uh, doctor, the receptionist said you'd see me now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.74,
      "end_seconds": 12.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "That's alright, take a seat. Tell me why you've come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.52,
      "end_seconds": 25.79,
      "duration_seconds": 13.27,
      "text": "So the thing is, um, I've got swelling in my left calf. I've never really been one for hospitals. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.19,
      "end_seconds": 28.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.6,
      "end_seconds": 37.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.28,
      "text": "Well, it's been ten days, I'm fairly sure. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.11,
      "end_seconds": 45.91,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "Okay. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind. I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.67,
      "end_seconds": 59.88,
      "duration_seconds": 13.21,
      "text": "It's worse with standing. I get some relief from raising the leg. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. Oh, I've had heaviness in the leg too, for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.82,
      "end_seconds": 64.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Alright, how would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.72,
      "end_seconds": 72.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.17,
      "text": "Moderate, I'd say. Hmm, and there's pain in that calf as well, one week now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.93,
      "end_seconds": 75.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Has there been any chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.74,
      "end_seconds": 78.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "No. No chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.2,
      "end_seconds": 81.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Any breathlessness, fever or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.23,
      "end_seconds": 86.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Right, uh, nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.17,
      "end_seconds": 90.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.15,
      "end_seconds": 93.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "So, no, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.82,
      "end_seconds": 96.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "So, do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.67,
      "end_seconds": 102.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.56,
      "end_seconds": 104.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.23,
      "end_seconds": 107.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.19,
      "end_seconds": 111.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Alright, any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.98,
      "end_seconds": 121.38,
      "duration_seconds": 9.4,
      "text": "So, I've had arthritis in my knees, yes. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.25,
      "end_seconds": 130.18,
      "duration_seconds": 7.93,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Yes, I can see the arthritis in my knees in your file as well. Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.56,
      "end_seconds": 135.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Yes, you know, I had my gallbladder removed, in 2016."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.92,
      "end_seconds": 138.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.47,
      "end_seconds": 143.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "I take diclofenac, when needed for the joint pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.18,
      "end_seconds": 145.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.46,
      "end_seconds": 153.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "50 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.9,
      "end_seconds": 154.6,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.59,
      "end_seconds": 159.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Paracetamol. I take it 500 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.42,
      "end_seconds": 163.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.96,
      "end_seconds": 166.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "My sister has thyroid problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.61,
      "end_seconds": 169.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "So, I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.92,
      "end_seconds": 177.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.39,
      "end_seconds": 199.2,
      "duration_seconds": 11.81,
      "text": "Okay: BMI works out to 28.3, pulse 105, SpO2 96 percent on room air, temperature 36.8, BP is 134 over 76, weight 97 kilos, respiratory rate 16, height 185 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.21,
      "end_seconds": 204.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.83,
      "end_seconds": 207.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.63,
      "end_seconds": 222.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "The left calf is bigger than the right, tender along the vein."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.6,
      "end_seconds": 225.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Okay, open wide for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.64,
      "end_seconds": 240.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "The right leg looks normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.69,
      "end_seconds": 266.84,
      "duration_seconds": 21.15,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like a possible deep vein clot. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. It could also be a muscle strain, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.38,
      "end_seconds": 269.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.17,
      "end_seconds": 281.95,
      "duration_seconds": 10.78,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a possible deep vein clot, but I'd like to confirm. We should do a Doppler scan of the leg for suspected DVT."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.49,
      "end_seconds": 287.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.17,
      "end_seconds": 296.34,
      "duration_seconds": 8.17,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a D-dimer blood test for suspected DVT. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.34,
      "end_seconds": 298.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.2,
      "end_seconds": 315.47,
      "duration_seconds": 16.27,
      "text": "Keep walking gently, and don't massage the calf. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. Please don't sit on it if you get chest pain or sudden breathlessness. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.27,
      "end_seconds": 316.97,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.83,
      "end_seconds": 323.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "Come back in two days. I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 323.94,
      "end_seconds": 327.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "No, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.4,
      "end_seconds": 329.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}